# OpenClaw Direct Chat - Final Implementation
## ✅ Status: WORKING
The chat command is now implemented correctly and connects **directly to AI providers** without needing the gateway.
## What Was Built
A simple, direct chat interface that:
- ✅ Connects directly to AI providers (Google Antigravity, Anthropic, OpenAI, etc.)
- ✅ No gateway required
- ✅ Uses existing provider authentication
- ✅ Maintains conversation history
- ✅ Streams responses in real-time
- ✅ Simple readline interface
## Usage
```bash
# Basic usage (uses default provider/model from config)
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat
# With specific provider
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat --provider anthropic --model claude-opus-4-5
# With Google Antigravity
bun scripts/run-node.mjs chat --provider google-antigravity --model gemini-3-flash
```
## Commands
While in chat:
- Type your message and press Enter
- `/clear` - Clear conversation history
- `/help` - Show help
- `exit` or `quit` - Exit chat
