## Authentication
The chat command uses your existing provider authentication from OpenClaw config.
### Setup Authentication
```bash
# Configure provider authentication
bun scripts/run-node.mjs configure
# Or use the onboarding wizard
bun scripts/run-node.mjs onboard
```
### Supported Providers
- **google-antigravity** - Google Antigravity OAuth
- **anthropic** - Anthropic API key
- **openai** - OpenAI API key
- **google** - Google Gemini API
- **azure-openai-responses** - Azure OpenAI
- And more...
## Architecture
```
User Input (readline)
    ↓
Chat CLI (chat-direct.ts)
    ↓
resolveModel() - Get model configuration
    ↓
streamSimple() - Direct provider call
    ↓
AI Provider (Google/Anthropic/OpenAI/etc.)
    ↓
Stream Response → User
```
## Key Features
### ✅ No Gateway Dependency
- Connects directly to AI providers
- No need to run gateway server
- Simpler architecture
### ✅ Real-time Streaming
- Responses stream as they're generated
- Uses async iteration over events
- Immediate feedback
### ✅ Conversation History
- Maintains full conversation context
- Can clear history with `/clear`
- History persists during session
### ✅ Error Handling
- Clear error messages
- Authentication guidance
- Graceful failure recovery
## Implementation Details
### File: `openclaw-standalone/src/cli/chat-direct.ts`
**Key Functions:**
- `registerChatDirectCli()` - Registers the command
- `runDirectChat()` - Main chat loop
- Uses `resolveModel()` from pi-embedded-runner
- Uses `streamSimple()` from @mariozechner/pi-ai
**Dependencies:**
- `@mariozechner/pi-ai` - AI provider abstraction
- `readline` - Terminal input/output
- Existing OpenClaw config and auth
### Event Stream Processing
```typescript
const stream = streamSimple(model, { messages });
for await (const event of stream) {
  if (event.type === "text_delta" && event.delta) {
    process.stdout.write(event.delta);
  }
}
const result = await stream.result();
messages.push(result);
```
## Configuration
Uses existing OpenClaw configuration from `~/.openclaw/openclaw.json`:
```json
{
  "agents": {
    "defaults": {
      "model": {
        "primary": "google-antigravity/gemini-3-flash"
      }
    }
  },
  "auth": {
    "profiles": {
      "google-antigravity:your@email.com": {
        "provider": "google-antigravity",
        "mode": "oauth"
      }
    }
  }
}
```
