## Troubleshooting
### "Failed to resolve model"
**Solution**: Check your config has the model defined
```bash
cat ~/.openclaw/openclaw.json | grep -A 5 '"model"'
```
### "OAuth authentication required"
**Solution**: Run the configuration wizard
```bash
bun scripts/run-node.mjs configure
```
### "401" or "403" errors
**Solution**: Re-authenticate with the provider
```bash
bun scripts/run-node.mjs configure --section auth
```
